{"id":12005,"date":"2024-01-31T11:58:12","date_gmt":"2024-01-31T11:58:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12005"},"modified":"2024-01-31T11:58:12","modified_gmt":"2024-01-31T11:58:12","slug":"casove-rozlisena-ramanova-spektroskopie-za-vysokych-teplot","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/casove-rozlisena-ramanova-spektroskopie-za-vysokych-teplot\/","title":{"rendered":"\u010casov\u011b rozli\u0161en\u00e1 Ramanova spektroskopie za vysok\u00fdch teplot"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Ramanova spektroskopie je velmi efektivn\u00ed technika pro on-line m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed za r\u016fzn\u00fdch procesn\u00edch a experiment\u00e1ln\u00edch podm\u00ednek. Mnoho f\u00e1zov\u00fdch zm\u011bn a dal\u0161\u00edch zaj\u00edmav\u00fdch reakc\u00ed se ov\u0161em d\u011bje za vysok\u00e9 teploty a\/nebo tlaku.<\/p>\n<p>K m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdch informac\u00ed v t\u011bchto extr\u00e9mn\u00edch podm\u00ednk\u00e1ch lze pou\u017e\u00edt Ramanovu spektroskopii ji\u017e \u0159adu let, a dokonce ji lze sou\u010dasn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edt pro p\u0159esn\u00e9 stanoven\u00ed teploty (Ramanova Termometrie). \u00a0Pro podobn\u00e9 experimenty je to obvykle bezkontaktn\u00ed technika, m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed lze nav\u00edc prov\u00e1d\u011bt na d\u00e1lku, co\u017e sni\u017euje riziko tepeln\u00e9ho po\u0161kozen\u00ed m\u011b\u0159ic\u00edch za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed. Dal\u0161\u00ed mo\u017enost\u00ed jsou i Ramanovy vysokoteplotn\u00ed ponorn\u00e9 sondy.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00fdzvou u bezkontaktn\u00edch vysokoteplotn\u00edch Ramanov\u00fdch m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed je v\u0161ak \u010dasto spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed interference zp\u016fsoben\u00e1 <strong>tepelnou emis\u00ed vzorku<\/strong>. To m\u016f\u017ee snadno zakr\u00fdt Ramanovy spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed p\u00e1sy, kter\u00e9 jsou n\u00e1sobn\u011b ni\u017e\u0161\u00ed intenzity ne\u017e tepeln\u00e9 z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed, a sn\u00ed\u017eit pom\u011br sign\u00e1lu k \u0161umu u\u017e p\u0159i teplot\u00e1ch p\u0159esahuj\u00edc\u00edch u\u017e cca 500 \u00b0C, p\u0159i\u010dem\u017e procesn\u00ed aplikace molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie se pohybuj\u00ed dokonce okolo 1600 \u00b0C \u2013 nap\u0159. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/blog\/high-temperature-measurements-at-shanghai-university\">zde<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Nejb\u011b\u017en\u011bj\u0161\u00ed metody pro omezen\u00ed tepeln\u00e9 interference s\u00a0Ramanovou spektroskopi\u00ed zahrnuj\u00ed \u010dasov\u011b rozli\u0161en\u00e9 techniky Ramanovy spektroskopie (Time-gated Raman), UV Ramanova spektroskopie (obvykle lasery pod 300 nm, v\u00edce <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/uv-ramanova-spektroskopie\/\">zde<\/a>) a techniky filtrov\u00e1n\u00ed z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed (spatial filtering). Nejm\u00e9n\u011b instrumenta\u010dn\u011b a finan\u010dn\u011b n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e1 technika pro podobn\u00e9 typy experiment\u016f je pr\u00e1v\u011b \u010dasov\u011b rozli\u0161en\u00e1 Ramanova spektroskopie (Time-Gated Raman s\u00a0pulzn\u00edm excita\u010dn\u00edm laserem).<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12008\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12008\" style=\"width: 550px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12008 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/2a110d04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"550\" height=\"574\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/2a110d04.png 550w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/2a110d04-287x300.png 287w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12008\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">PicoRaman M3 spektrometr \u2013 v\u00edce <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/picoraman-m3\/\">zde<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>P\u0159i m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed Ramanov\u00fdch spekter za vysok\u00fdch teplot je nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 intenzita na detektoru sou\u010dtem Ramanova sign\u00e1lu a tepeln\u00e9 emise (fluorescence zde nen\u00ed uva\u017eov\u00e1na). Pro dosa\u017een\u00ed optim\u00e1ln\u00edch v\u00fdsledk\u016f tedy chceme udr\u017eet pom\u011br detekovan\u00e9ho Ramanova rozptylu vzhledem k tepeln\u00e9 emisi (Term\u00e1ln\u00ed pozad\u00ed \u2013 thermal BG) vzorkem co nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ed. Pulzn\u00ed techniky s \u010dasov\u00fdm rozli\u0161en\u00edm v\u00a0\u0159\u00e1du pikosekund se toho sna\u017e\u00ed dos\u00e1hnout pomoc\u00ed velmi rychl\u00fdch laserov\u00fdch pulz\u016f s\u00a0vysokou energi\u00ed a sb\u011brem dat pouze b\u011bhem t\u011bchto pulz\u016f.<\/p>\n<p>Obr\u00e1zek n\u00ed\u017ee porovn\u00e1v\u00e1 kontinu\u00e1ln\u00ed vlnov\u00fd (CW \u2013 tradi\u010dn\u00ed Raman) a pulzn\u00ed sb\u011br dat p\u0159i vysokoteplotn\u00edch aplikac\u00edch. Toto srovn\u00e1n\u00ed plat\u00ed i pro dal\u0161\u00ed spojit\u00e9 interference, nap\u0159. slune\u010dn\u00ed sv\u011btlo.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12010\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12010\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12010 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/38bbacb0-1024x476.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/38bbacb0-1024x476.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/38bbacb0-300x139.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/38bbacb0-768x357.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/38bbacb0-1536x714.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/38bbacb0.png 1547w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12010\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Porovn\u00e1n\u00ed vztahu mezi Ramanov\u00fdm sign\u00e1lem a term\u00e1ln\u00ed emis\u00ed vzorkem mezi tradi\u010dn\u00edm Ramanov\u00fdm spektrometrem vybaven\u00fdm kontinu\u00e1ln\u00edm laserem (CW \u2013 continuous wave) a Time-gated technologi\u00ed s\u00a0pulzn\u00edm laserem (pulsed)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Zat\u00edmco klasick\u00e9 techniky Ramanovy spektroskopie shroma\u017e\u010fuj\u00ed informace kontinu\u00e1ln\u011b, pulzn\u00ed syst\u00e9my zaznamen\u00e1vaj\u00ed data pouze b\u011bhem velmi kr\u00e1tk\u00fdch pulz\u016f. V\u00fdsledn\u00fd pom\u011br Ramanova sign\u00e1lu k tepeln\u00e9mu pozad\u00ed je pak dostate\u010dn\u011b vysok\u00fd. Vysokov\u00fdkonn\u00e9 pulzn\u00ed lasery mohou samoz\u0159ejm\u011b podporovat degradaci vzork\u016f, ale to nen\u00ed probl\u00e9m u t\u011bch, kter\u00e9 odol\u00e1vaj\u00ed velmi vysok\u00fdm teplot\u00e1m.<\/p>\n<p>Dal\u0161\u00ed v\u00fdhodou pulzn\u00edch \u010dasov\u011b rozli\u0161en\u00fdch technik je to, \u017ee tepeln\u00e9 pozad\u00ed lze tak\u00e9 m\u011b\u0159it t\u011bsn\u011b p\u0159ed pulzem jako pozad\u00ed. T\u00edmto zp\u016fsobem lze m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed tohoto pozad\u00ed \u010dasto opakovat a v\u00fdsledek tohoto m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed pozad\u00ed nebude zahrnovat \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 Ramanovy odezvy, proto\u017ee m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed prob\u00edh\u00e1 mezi budic\u00edmi laserov\u00fdmi impulsy. Ten lze pot\u00e9 jednodu\u0161e pou\u017e\u00edt k dal\u0161\u00edmu ode\u010dten\u00ed tepeln\u00e9ho vlivu. T\u00e9to techniky bylo tak\u00e9 pou\u017eito u p\u0159\u00edkladu na n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edm obr\u00e1zku:<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12012\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12012\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12012 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/d3463c29-1024x518.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"405\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/d3463c29-1024x518.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/d3463c29-300x152.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/d3463c29-768x389.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/01\/d3463c29.png 1310w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12012\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Porovn\u00e1n\u00ed Ramanov\u00fdch spekter p\u0159i vysokoteplotn\u00ed kalcinaci spodumenu (LiAlSi\u2082O\u2086) v\u00a0rozmez\u00ed teplot 20\u20131050 \u00b0C, f\u00e1zov\u00e1 p\u0159em\u011bna \u03b1-spodumenu na \u03b2-spodumen. 100\u2013200 ps pulzy + CMOS-SPAD (Single Photon Avalanche Diode) array detektor.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ramanova spektroskopie je velmi efektivn\u00ed technika pro on-line m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed za r\u016fzn\u00fdch procesn\u00edch a experiment\u00e1ln\u00edch podm\u00ednek. Mnoho f\u00e1zov\u00fdch zm\u011bn a dal\u0161\u00edch zaj\u00edmav\u00fdch reakc\u00ed se ov\u0161em d\u011bje za vysok\u00e9 teploty a\/nebo tlaku. K m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdch informac\u00ed v t\u011bchto extr\u00e9mn\u00edch podm\u00ednk\u00e1ch lze pou\u017e\u00edt Ramanovu spektroskopii ji\u017e \u0159adu let, a dokonce ji lze sou\u010dasn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edt pro p\u0159esn\u00e9 stanoven\u00ed teploty [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12006,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[128,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12005","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-128","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>\u010casov\u011b rozli\u0161en\u00e1 Ramanova spektroskopie za vysok\u00fdch teplot - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/casove-rozlisena-ramanova-spektroskopie-za-vysokych-teplot\/\" \/>\n<meta p